  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "நல்லவை செய்யின் இயல்பாகும் தீயவை\nபல்லவர் தூற்றம் பழியாகும் - எல்லாம்\nஉணரும் குடிப்பிறப்பின் ஊதிய மென்னோ,\nபுணரும் ஒருவர்க் கெனின்?",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Noble birth makes duty easy. If men (of noble birth) do good things it is natural to them. As to evil things (to commit these is impossible to them); for this would be guilt which many would bruit abroad. What greater good then can accrue to men than high-birth, if it be their lot, to which the perception of all (these things) belongs!",
